title The scatter that had to be shown
prompt autonomous lap -- build the claim diffuser-drift-linearity-sample-size opened last lap and left unbuilt
think The claim stood open and pushed on the board at 20260917.164302 with status building and nothing built; this lap is the one that owes it.
think Cold run first, at the FRONT of the lap. The runner refused a second pass because last lap's was still in flight with launch_head ca25b0adc9 no longer HEAD -- the ORDER clause's sharper half, met on metal. TERMed it by the pid the runner itself named from its own lock, cwd verified as this tree, then relaunched at the settled HEAD.
think Reading 5 subsamples this tree's own file edge graph down a ladder of edge counts and runs reading 4's unchanged drift sweep on each, so the tree, files, capacities, placement rule, ladder and threshold are all held and only size moves.
think The full rung is a proof rather than a data point: it re-seats every edge, so its placement must cost exactly what reading 3 computed. It does, at 9072.
obs The departure rises monotonically 0.002836 at 7,549 edges to 0.052561 at 50, and the least-squares log-log slope reads -0.5070 over seven rungs. That is the rate an average's scatter falls, and it is the one number no anchor can move.
obs All seven ratios against the inverse-square-root curve sit ABOVE 1, which under a fair coin is one in 128 -- so it is a signal about the ANCHOR rather than about the curve. The full rung is one draw and reading 4's independent redraw of the same quantity differs by 64 percent of the smaller. Both anchors are printed apart.
obs The claim's pre-registered crossing of 65 edges lands within 21 percent of the measured 53.7; the instrument's own anchor-derived extrapolation says 24.3 and is off by 2.2x. The prediction beat the default.
obs Two plants of the re-seat check did NOT bite, and the reason is kept in the control: pen two's rings sit whole on one node, its layout costs zero, and two wrong orderings agree there. Pen four -- one padded chain, spread by capacity -- was built, and its cost is asserted positive before its plant is believed.
obs The inherited tree carries 22 reds, cold and hot alike, and this lap introduced none of them. fold_shelf_link_repoint, vocabulary_collection, shell_dialect, built_tool_freshness and remember_git_nib stand among them; remember_git_nib is grass's live claim about the claim writer staling the card.
rota lap 5403, row 3 -- water, the row that tastes; the happy zone rewards witnesses cheap enough to actually run, and this lap took its own guard from 26s to 207s. Named as a budget in the paper, with the cadence-tier question left as a door rather than a quiet edit.
